window.LEARN_CONTENT=window.LEARN_CONTENT||{};window.LEARN_CONTENT["a-12a9e9ba6124222c"]={"zh":"<p><a id=\"upgrade-your-api-integration\"></a></p> <h1 id=\"api\">升级你的 API 集成</h1> <p>将应用升级到最新的 OpenAI API 模型。</p> <p>使用 Codex 更新现有的 OpenAI API 集成，使其采用最新推荐的模型和 API 功能，并在发布前检查回归问题。</p> <p><a id=\"best-for\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_1\">适合哪些情况</h2> <ul> <li>从较旧模型或 API 接口升级的团队。</li> <li>需要在明确验证的同时保持行为不变的代码仓库。</li> </ul> <p><a id=\"skills-plugins\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_2\">技能与插件</h2> <table> <thead> <tr> <th>技能或插件</th> <th>用途</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td><a href=\"https://github.com/openai/skills/tree/main/skills/.curated/openai-docs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">$openai-docs（需联网）</a></td> <td>在 Codex 修改实现之前，先获取当前的模型迁移和 API 指南。</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <p><a id=\"starter-prompt\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_3\">起步提示词</h2> <p>安全地升级集成</p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">使用 $openai-docs 将此 OpenAI 集成升级到最新推荐的模型和 API 功能。\n\n具体来说，请查找针对该特定模型的最新模型与提示词指南。\n\n要求：\n- 首先盘点代码仓库当前使用的模型、端点和工具假设。\n- 找出能迁移到最新受支持路径的最小方案。\n- 除非新 API 或模型要求必须改变，否则保持原有行为。\n- 根据最新模型提示词指南更新提示词。\n- 指出需要人工审查的提示词、工具或响应结构变化。\n</code></pre> <p><a id=\"related-links\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_4\">关联文档</h2> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/api/docs/guides/latest-model?model=gpt-5.6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">使用 GPT-5.6（需联网）</a></li> <li><a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/learn/docs-mcp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">OpenAI Docs MCP（需联网）</a></li> <li><a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/api/docs/guides/evals\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">评测指南（需联网）</a></li> </ul> <blockquote> <p>如需完整文档索引，请参阅 <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt（需联网）</a>。在文档页面 URL 末尾添加 <code>.md</code>，即可获取 Markdown 版本。</p> </blockquote> <p><a id=\"introduction\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_5\">简介</h2> <p>OpenAI 发布新模型和 API 功能时，我们建议你升级集成，以获得最新改进。从一种模型换到另一种模型，通常不只是改一下模型名称那么简单。</p> <p>API 可能会发生变化。例如，针对 GPT-5.4 模型，我们增加了一个新的 <code>phase</code> 参数，需要包含在 assistant 消息中；更重要的是，模型行为可能不同，因此需要调整现有提示词。</p> <p>迁移到新模型时，不仅要完成必要的代码修改，还应评估它对工作流的影响。</p> <p><a id=\"leverage-the-openai-docs-skill\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"openai-docs\">使用 OpenAI Docs 技能</h2> <p><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/guides/latest-model.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">模型指南</a>汇总了各代模型的 API 功能、模型行为、迁移和提示词指导。</p> <p>OpenAI Docs 技能还提供了<a href=\"https://github.com/openai/codex/blob/6323f0104d17d211029faab149231ba787f7da37/codex-rs/skills/src/assets/samples/openai-docs/references/upgrading-to-gpt-5p4.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">具体指导（需联网）</a>，可作为迁移示例。升级到当前目标时，请使用<a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/guides/latest-model.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">模型指南</a>。</p> <p>Codex 现在默认附带 OpenAI Docs 技能。使用 OpenAI API 构建时，请在提示词中提及它，以便 Codex 获取最新文档和指导。</p> <p><a id=\"build-a-robust-evals-pipeline\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_6\">构建可靠的评测流程</h2> <p>Codex 可以根据最新提示词指南自动更新提示词，但你还应能自动验证集成是否正常工作。</p> <p>请建立一套每次修改时都能运行的评测流程，以确认行为没有回归。<a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/cookbook/examples/evaluation/building_resilient_prompts_using_an_evaluation_flywheel.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">这篇 cookbook 指南</a>详细介绍了如何使用 <a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/guides/evals.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Evals API</a> 实现这一点。</p>","en":"<h1 id=\"upgrade-your-api-integration\">Upgrade your API integration</h1> <p>Upgrade your app to the latest OpenAI API models.</p> <p>Use Codex to update your existing OpenAI API integration to the latest recommended models and API features, while checking for regressions before you ship.</p> <h2 id=\"best-for\">Best for</h2> <ul> <li>Teams upgrading from older models or API surfaces</li> <li>Repos that need behavior-preserving migrations with explicit validation</li> </ul> <h2 id=\"skills-plugins\">Skills &amp; Plugins</h2> <table> <thead> <tr> <th>Skill or plugin</th> <th>Why use it</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td><a href=\"https://github.com/openai/skills/tree/main/skills/.curated/openai-docs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">$openai-docs (online)</a></td> <td>Pull the current model, migration, and API guidance before Codex makes edits to your implementation.</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <h2 id=\"starter-prompt\">Starter prompt</h2> <p>Upgrade the Integration Safely</p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">Use $openai-docs to upgrade this OpenAI integration to the latest recommended model and API features.\n\nSpecifically, look for the latest model and prompt guidance for this specific model.\n\nRequirements:\n- Start by inventorying the current models, endpoints, and tool assumptions in the repo.\n- Identify the smallest migration plan that gets us onto the latest supported path.\n- Preserve behavior unless a change is required by the new API or model.\n- Update prompts using the latest model prompt guidance. \n- Call out any prompt, tool, or response-shape changes we need to review manually.\n</code></pre> <h2 id=\"related-links\">Related links</h2> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/api/docs/guides/latest-model?model=gpt-5.6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Using GPT-5.6 (online)</a></li> <li><a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/learn/docs-mcp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">OpenAI Docs MCP (online)</a></li> <li><a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/api/docs/guides/evals\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Evals guide (online)</a></li> </ul> <blockquote> <p>For the complete documentation index, see <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt (online)</a>. Markdown versions of documentation pages are available by appending <code>.md</code> to the page URL.</p> </blockquote> <h2 id=\"introduction\">Introduction</h2> <p>As we release new models and API features, we recommend upgrading your integration to benefit from the latest improvements. Changing from one model to another is often not as simple as just updating the model name.</p> <p>There might be changes to the API–for example, for the GPT-5.4 model, we added a new <code>phase</code> parameter to the assistant message that is important to include in your integration–but most importantly, model behavior can be different and require changes to your existing prompts.</p> <p>When migrating to a new model, you should make sure to not only make the necessary code changes, but also evaluate the impact on your workflows.</p> <h2 id=\"leverage-the-openai-docs-skill\">Leverage the OpenAI Docs skill</h2> <p>The <a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/guides/latest-model.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Model guidance</a> page combines API feature, model behavior, migration, and prompting guidance for each model generation.</p> <p>The OpenAI Docs skill also includes <a href=\"https://github.com/openai/codex/blob/6323f0104d17d211029faab149231ba787f7da37/codex-rs/skills/src/assets/samples/openai-docs/references/upgrading-to-gpt-5p4.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">specific guidance (online)</a> as a concrete migration reference. For the current upgrade target, use the <a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/guides/latest-model.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Model guidance</a> page.</p> <p>Codex now automatically comes with the OpenAI Docs skill, so make sure to mention it in your prompt to access all the latest documentation and guidance when building with the OpenAI API.</p> <h2 id=\"build-a-robust-evals-pipeline\">Build a robust evals pipeline</h2> <p>Codex can automatically update your prompts based on the latest prompt guidance, but you should have a way to automate verifying your integration is working as expected.</p> <p>Make sure to build an evals pipeline that you can run every time you make changes to your integration, to verify there is no regression in behavior.</p> <p>This <a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/cookbook/examples/evaluation/building_resilient_prompts_using_an_evaluation_flywheel.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">cookbook guide</a> covers in detail how to do this using our <a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/guides/evals.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Evals API</a>.</p>"};
